{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Wayfare-labs/wayfare/pulls/517","id":4646070666,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTt0c788AAAABFO1pig","html_url":"https://github.com/Wayfare-labs/wayfare/pull/517","diff_url":"https://github.com/Wayfare-labs/wayfare/pull/517.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Wayfare-labs/wayfare/pull/517.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Wayfare-labs/wayfare/issues/517","number":517,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"fix(ui): announce results to assistive technology","user":{"login":"sojetunde8","id":287985093,"node_id":"U_kgDOESpNxQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/287985093?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sojetunde8","html_url":"https://github.com/sojetunde8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sojetunde8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sojetunde8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sojetunde8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sojetunde8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sojetunde8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sojetunde8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sojetunde8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sojetunde8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sojetunde8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes #302\n\n## Summary\n\n- `render()` and `renderTrend()` replace `#out.innerHTML` wholesale, and an innerHTML swap raises nothing a screen reader announces — a result could render and a screen-reader user would never know. A new `#out-status` live region (`role=\"status\"`, `aria-live=\"polite\"`) now mirrors every outcome.\n- Announced, in the engine's own words and without deriving any figure:\n  - a measurement: corridor, integrity state, `finding` verbatim, then the recommendation (`recommended_size`, `loss_pct`, `verdict`) or the explicit refusal (\"No size tested is worth taking\") or, when unscored, \"no verdict could be issued\" — UNDETERMINED-equivalent is announced as unknown, never as failure;\n  - the trend: window (run count, first → last recorded run), latest integrity state, and \"no stored runs yet\" for an empty history;\n  - trend size changes (\"now shows the 100 USDC size\");\n  - every error path, including the cold-start boot failure and the live-measure failure.\n- The region is cleared before each message so identical results re-announce; text lands 50ms after the paint so the swap is picked up.\n- Every announced figure is read straight off the served document — nothing is synthesised, and no engine state, threshold or check semantic is touched.\n\n## Scope\n\n- `server/index.html` only: one new span in the controls row, an `announce`/`announceResult`/`announceTrend` helper, and call sites in `measure`, `loadTrend`, `renderTrend`'s size handler and the boot path. No build step added.\n\n## Testing\n\n- Static single-file page; verified every announcement call site matches a render/error path in the file (measure success/error, loadTrend success/error/empty, size change, boot success/error).\n- The live region is `polite`, so nothing interrupts a screen reader mid-read; states are announced from document fields (`integrity`, `finding`, `recommended`, `runs`), which are the engine's outputs.\n\n## Files changed\n\n- server/index.html","created_at":"2026-09-26T09:00:42Z","updated_at":"2026-09-28T09:12:37Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"3b3e7cf61b853ebe7b5cbb82a2796e7b3f7142e3","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[{"id":11773731092,"node_id":"LA_kwDOTt0c788AAAACvcThFA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Wayfare-labs/wayfare/labels/needs-maintainer-review","name":"needs-maintainer-review","color":"e99695","default":false,"description":"Design decision needed before work starts","archived_at":null,"archived_